    >[ ] Suppress generation against live and archived occurrences =core-habit-dedup $Check live and archived occurrence lineage before generating, so a completed or cancelled slot is never regenerated, without adding archive data to live views. Done when habit_archive_dedup tests pass and archive files stay unchanged.$ !2 ^2026-10-26T05:15 <core-habit-catchup #01a176a3-0d78-7d52-9ab4-4b9b34d095b4
    >[ ] Preserve occurrence history through rule edits =core-habit-rules $When a recurrence rule or template is edited, generate newly due slots once and leave existing Actions, ids, states and archived lineage unchanged. Done when habit_rule_history tests cover frequency, start, exclusion and template edits.$ !2 ^2026-10-26T05:15 <core-habit-dedup #01a176a3-0d87-7231-ace6-6438e0d41c09
    >[ ] Project Habits and merge series and occurrence edits =core-habit-projection $Write recurring VEVENTs to plans/ and merge calendar edits back: series edits go to the Habit line and RECURRENCE-ID edits go to the Action. Done when habit_calendar_roundtrip passes, including moved occurrences keyed by RECURRENCE-ID and non-IANA TZIDs either mapped or refused with a clear error.$ !2 ^2026-10-26T05:15 <core-habit-rules #01a176a3-0d96-7910-9b46-d3a93e3e6aa7
