[ ] Promote an action to a subcharter from the CLI =promote-action $One verb turns any action into a subcharter of its charter, keeping its UUID as a kind change does: name to title, description to body, other fields to frontmatter under actions.schema.json names, children to the charter's top-level actions with ids kept. A flat parent converts to directory form. The new charter is New; its alias is the action's or a generic subcharter-NN. Write the charter first, then remove the line: a UUID that is both is an unfinished promotion, and doctor reports it.$ !3 ^2026-11-25T02:41 <charter-predecessor <charter-defaults #01a21094-a625-7540-9485-3066898e0ee5
